# docker-agent.suite — the operator-driven flows that run only in Docker
# worlds.
#
# Run it with `--driver agent --docker`: an operator in node1's container
# performs each flow from its prompt.md, and the same oracles that judge the
# scripted runs judge these. agent.suite holds the flows a VM world also
# runs; the flows here either name nodes the VM lab does not run (node3,
# acn-b1, acn-b2) or each start a world of their own, which in VMs costs a
# full world open per test.
#
# The order is a preference among siblings; the planner computes the run
# order from each test's `after`.
adopt-claimed-node
swarm-roster-sync
expel-propagation
bootstrap-passphrase
distribution-gate-setup
import-user-software-key
